	(text "AVDD (pin 7) and PVDD (pin 15) are REQUIRED even though AUXADC0-5 are unused and\neven if the PLL were unused -- ADAU1466 Rev.C p.33, V-22. Do not drop either rail.\nThe six AUXADC no-connects below make 'drop AVDD' look like a free optimisation. It is not."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 149.86 34.29 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "bc6528c6-1390-5d1a-95cf-f000f348a222")
	)
	(text "R1 holds RESET low if its driver is absent or high-Z (Rev.C p.34), backing up the\ninternal pull-down. Fail-safe polarity: unpowered = held in reset."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 149.86 45.72 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "91bc5fe3-394d-526a-ae5a-be9a0d514d92")
	)
	(text "Every pin on this sheet has an explicit disposition -- net label or no-connect (F28).\nUnused-pin policy is PER PART, sourced from that part's own datasheet. No board-wide default."
